  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung looks at his sons and then at Pear Blossom.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son returns home.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We are setting up a great store and we will make a great deal of money out of it.\"",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We will sell out the good land you have there and put up a great house in its place and we will have a gate that opens into the town and we will be the greatest men in the town, my brother and I.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung feels the weight of his sons' words.",
  "the eldest son (to the eldest son): \"Well, well, and what is this?\"",
